@ Yoshi bounces on Urchins (code/tweaks/yoshi_urchin.cpp). Enemy::collisionYoshi's entry is
@ `ldr r3, [r2, #0x88]` (not PC-relative), so the trampoline can replay it.

YoshiUrchin_collisionYoshi:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x002A2D78
    symbol:     ModBase::urchin::collisionYoshi(Enemy*, ActiveCollider*, ActiveCollider*)
    trampoline: ModBase::urchin::collisionYoshi_orig(Enemy*, ActiveCollider*, ActiveCollider*)
